ned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $A=1,B=-2,$ and $C=3.$ Therefore, our final result is\n\n$$\n\\frac{4{x}^{2}+10x+6}{({x}^{2}+3x+4)(x+3)}=\\frac{x-2}{({x}^{2}+3x+4)}+\\frac{3}{(x+3)}.\n$$" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354315 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354316 13194139535539 true] [17592186354315 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354317 13194139535539 true] [17592186354315 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354318 13194139535539 true] [17592186354315 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354319 13194139535539 true] [17592186354315 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354320 13194139535539 true] [17592186354315 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535539 true] [17592186354315 1041 "selection" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354315 1104 #edb/ref 17592186354318 13194139535539 true] [17592186354315 1110 #uuid "f1b91643-5355-5918-9758-59dee221b7f2" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354316 1034 "\\frac{x-3}{({x}^{2}+3x+4)}+\\frac{5}{(x+3)}" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354316 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535539 true] [17592186354316 1111 #uuid "51261d45-18aa-565e-bd5e-0de7772a7f6b" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354317 1034 "\\frac{2x+1}{({x}^{2}+3x+4)}+\\frac{3}{(x+3)}" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354317 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535539 true] [17592186354317 1111 #uuid "2de8007c-efb4-50d2-9fac-a556222eba6d" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354318 1034 "\\frac{x-2}{({x}^{2}+3x+4)}+\\frac{3}{(x+3)}" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354318 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535539 true] [17592186354318 1111 #uuid "c9cfb5b7-a323-5137-8dd9-6980395cee4c" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354319 1034 "\\frac{2x-1}{({x}^{2}+3x+4)}-\\frac{4}{(x+3)}" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354319 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535539 true] [17592186354319 1111 #uuid "6fc02512-1729-5caf-ba08-55e1876ec02c" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354320 1034 "\\frac{3x-2}{({x}^{2}+3x+4)}-\\frac{2}{(x+3)}" 13194139535539 true] [17592186354320 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535539 true] [17592186354320 1111 #uuid "9083c75f-a0c5-5f36-b62c-9fbf205ed4ec" 13194